  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation  GET.Transform - Support to the energy sector in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">irst, it will support improvements to the business climate for the renewable energy sector in Peru, with a specific focus on directly facilitating European investments. This component will address regulatory, procedural, and institutional constraints affecting project development, while also targeting the resolution of concrete bottlenecks faced by specific European investment projects. By improving permitting processes, strengthening institutional coordination, and providing tailored support to unblock priority investments, the action will help reduce risks, delays, and costs for European companies operating in the Peruvian renewable energy market.Second, the action will promote sub-regional energy integration, with a particular focus on electricity interconnections involving Peru. This component will support cross-border cooperation, regulatory alignment, and regional electricity market development, contributing to greater system reliability, optimized resource use, and increased cross-border power exchanges in the Andean region.</narrative>
  </description>
